{
    "key": "dj",
    "templateKey": "repobot-dj",
    "title": "DJ / electronic artist",
    "description": "A DJ site in a brutalist grid-and-mono register, paper-on-ink dark: a numbered mix shelf with native waveform players playing bundled original electronic loops (paste SoundCloud / Mixcloud / Spotify links and the players swap to the real transmissions), set dates that split upcoming/past at render time with a computed \"Tonight\" badge, and a booking form that carries the tech-rider ask. Mono-utility register worn achromatic — no hue anywhere.",
    "marketingExampleTitle": "DJ / electronic artist site",
    "category": "music",
    "homePath": "/",
    "previewPath": "/dj",
    "homeViewDir": "web/app/src/View/Dj",
    "base": "landing",
    "clientOnly": true,
    "capabilities": ["IOS", "ANDROID"],
    "isDefault": false,
    "forms": {
        "$comment": "Managed-form kinds, formKey -> kind (append-only vocabulary: RSVP | LEAD | MAILING_LIST | PROOFING). The list is the pack's subscriber base; booking inquiries run a lead pipeline.",
        "mailing-list": "MAILING_LIST",
        "booking": "LEAD"
    },
    "theme": {
        "$comment": "The achromatic overlay: mode dark opens the site paper-on-ink (its native club-night appearance; the appearance toggle still swaps to the ink-on-paper spec sheet), and the register's own inks ride as the project brand so app-side surfaces stay monochrome instead of the kernel default blue. Values match mono-utility's text inks — the landing style overrides pin accent to text, so the overlay and the pages agree.",
        "mode": "dark",
        "brand": {
            "primary": "#1b1d1b",
            "primaryDark": "#e6ece7"
        }
    },
    "contentContract": {
        "$comment": "The pack's content slots, as data (packs/README.md 'Content contract'). Sets are plain ISO dates — the pages compute the upcoming/past split and the badge at render time. Mixes default to bundled original demo loops; a mix's optional embedUrl swaps its player to a click-to-load streaming embed.",
        "module": "web/app/src/View/Dj/content.ts",
        "slots": {
            "artist.alias": { "kind": "text" },
            "artist.tagline": { "kind": "text" },
            "artist.location": { "kind": "text" },
            "artist.email": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.subheadline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.about.paragraphs": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 1 },
            "heroImages.booth": { "kind": "media" },
            "heroImages.portrait": { "kind": "media" },
            "sets": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 4,
                "item": {
                    "date": { "kind": "text" },
                    "city": { "kind": "text" },
                    "venue": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "mixes": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "index": { "kind": "text" },
                    "title": { "kind": "text" },
                    "style": { "kind": "text" },
                    "bpm": { "kind": "number" },
                    "notes": { "kind": "text" },
                    "cover": { "kind": "media" }
                }
            },
            "booking.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "booking.body": { "kind": "text" },
            "mailingList.title": { "kind": "text" },
            "mailingList.body": { "kind": "text" }
        }
    },
